---
import AwardCard from "../components/award-card.astro";
---

<div class="origin-section">
  <div class="origin-content">
    <h3>Bridging the Gap Between Pixel and Production.</h3>
    <div class="origin-descriptions">
      <p class="para">
        Design is not just visual—it is structural. Over the last decade, I've
        learned that the most effective products are born when design systems
        speak the same language as the codebase.
      </p>
      <p class="para">
        Currently, as a Senior Lead Designer at Infosys, I lead digital
        transformation initiatives for global enterprise clients. My approach is
        rooted in efficiency: I don't just design interfaces; I architect the
        ecosystems that power them. Whether it's automating design handoffs
        through custom Figma plugins or building modular React component
        libraries, my mission is to help teams build faster, stay consistent,
        and ship with confidence.
      </p>
    </div>
    <h4>Hall of Fame & Recognitions</h4>
    <div class="award-wrapper">
      <AwardCard
        award="Figma Best Business Maker"
        description="For forging high-impact tooling that accelerates product delivery."
        imgSrc="../../public/image/pugal-bg.png"
      />
      <AwardCard
        award="RISE Award - Best Innovator"
        description="For pioneering new tech and methodologies in cross-functional design workflows."
        imgSrc="../../public/image/pugal-bg.png"
      />
      <AwardCard
        award="Insta Award"
        description="Recognized without fail for rapid, reliable execution and problem-solving."
        imgSrc="../../public/image/pugal-bg.png"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="origin-pic">
    <img src="../../public/image/pugal-bg.png" />
  </div>
</div>

<style lang="scss" is:global>
  @use "../../public/sass/variables" as *;
  @use "../../public/sass/mixin" as *;
  @use "../../public/sass/root" as *;

  .origin-section {
    @include flex-element;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 4rem 8rem;

    .origin-content {
    }

    .origin-pic {
      min-width: 20rem;
      width: auto;
      max-width: 30rem;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 1rem;
      box-shadow: 0px 0.125rem 0.5rem 0.375rem var(--text-color-8);
    }
  }

  .award-wrapper {
    @include grid-element;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  }
</style>
